00:04:52,369 --> 00:04:53,202
in one chunk.

118
00:04:53,907 --> 00:04:57,194
And then here, numctx, this controls the

119
00:04:57,258 --> 00:04:58,460
context window

120
00:04:59,021 --> 00:05:01,426
that's being used because Ollama by default

121
00:05:01,426 --> 00:05:02,403
does not open up

122
00:05:02,964 --> 00:05:05,738
