123
00:05:05,850 --> 00:05:08,479
can use. They do have quite a big context

124
00:05:08,479 --> 00:05:10,723
window, but by default, that's not unlocked

125
00:05:11,204 --> 00:05:14,266
because all this context window also takes

126
00:05:14,266 --> 00:05:15,356
up space in memory,

127
00:05:16,093 --> 00:05:18,498
which is why I set a rather small context

128
00:05:18,498 --> 00:05:21,399
window size of 4,000 tokens here as a

129
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:21,880
default.

130
00:05:22,425 --> 00:05:24,220
But this can then be changed from anywhere

131
00:05:24,429 --> 00:05:25,856
where this function is called.

132
00:05:27,330 --> 00:05:28,420
Like for example, in

133
00:05:28,452 --> 00:05:30,312
extract_core_website_content.

