146
00:06:01,314 --> 00:06:03,206
And I'm using that for summarizing because

147
00:06:03,318 --> 00:06:06,011
again, these small models are actually

148
00:06:06,187 --> 00:06:08,816
really impressive and good at summarizing

149
00:06:08,993 --> 00:06:11,574
tasks, also at extraction. Tasks, but here I

