00:06:28,309 --> 00:06:29,014
parameters

158
00:06:29,832 --> 00:06:32,301
model, which is the biggest Gemma 3 model

159
00:06:32,557 --> 00:06:35,202
for generating the post. Because when it

160
00:06:35,202 --> 00:06:38,905
comes to creative work, to generating text,

161
00:06:39,209 --> 00:06:41,919
my experience is that the bigger models tend

162
00:06:41,951 --> 00:06:42,480
to perform

